{%- comment -%}
  Screen: dashboard / overview.

  Priority order is the approved one: status → next delivery → primary
  actions → products → deliveries → VetPoints → account rows → guarantee.

  Scoped to what Phoenix supports. Skip and Delay are the only schedule
  mutations; products, quantities, address and payment are read-only
  information. There is no paused state — Phoenix has no pause operation,
  so the only statuses are active and cancelled.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="dashboard" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-dash-h">

  {%- comment -%} Greeting + pets {%- endcomment -%}
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px;">
    <div>
      <h1 class="spp__h1 spp__h1--lg" id="spp-dash-h" style="margin-bottom:6px;">
        Hi <span data-spp-field="customer.firstName">Margaret</span>
      </h1>
      {%- comment -%}
        Identity-free copy. This paragraph is NOT a [data-spp-field] slot, so
        clearPlaceholders() cannot blank it in live mode — anything named here
        reaches a real customer verbatim. It previously named the prototype's
        two dogs.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <p style="margin:0;font:500 15px/1.4 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-body);">
        Your routine, at a glance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="spp__chips" data-spp-list="pets">
      <template data-spp-tpl="pets">
        <span class="spp__chip">
          <span class="spp__chip-dot" data-spp-field="initial">B</span>
          <span data-spp-field="name">Bella</span>
        </span>
      </template>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Cancelled banner (the only non-active state) {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="spp__banner spp__banner--cancelled" data-spp-when="status:cancelled" hidden>
    <span class="spp__banner-icon">&mdash;</span>
    <div style="flex:1;">
      <div class="spp__banner-title">Subscription cancelled</div>
      <p>
        No further charges will be made. Your details and VetPoints are kept, so you can pick the routine
        back up whenever you want.
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary spp__btn--inline" style="min-height:44px;font-size:14.5px;" data-spp-go="reactivate">Reactivate subscription</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="spp__split">

    {%- comment -%} ===== Main column ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="spp__split-main">

      {%- comment -%} Next delivery {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card spp__card--flush">
        <div class="spp__next-head">
          <span class="spp__badge">Next delivery</span>
          <span class="spp__next-ref" data-spp-field="subscription.reference">#VP-48210</span>
        </div>

        <div class="spp__next-body">
          <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
            <div class="spp__next-date" data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderMedium">Tue, Sep 8</div>
            <div class="spp__next-meta">
              <span data-spp-field="pricing.total">$62.73</span> ·
              every <span data-spp-field="subscription.intervalDays">60</span> days · free shipping
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="spp__next-thumbs" data-spp-list="lineThumbs">
            <template data-spp-tpl="lineThumbs">
              <span class="spp__thumb" data-spp-thumb>
                <img data-spp-img alt="">
              </span>
            </template>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="padding:0 18px 16px;">
          <div class="spp__progress" role="img" data-spp-field-aria="subscription.progressLabel">
            <span data-spp-style-width="subscription.shipProgress"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="spp__progress-legend">
            <span>Order builds now</span>
            <span data-spp-field="subscription.daysAway">18 days away</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%} Skip and Delay both map to /update-next-billing-date {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="spp__actions-3" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);">
          <button type="button" class="spp__action" data-spp-sheet="skip">
            {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'skip' %}
            Skip
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="spp__action" data-spp-sheet="delay">
            {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'clock-action' %}
            Delay
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="spp__action" data-spp-go="subscription">
            {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'list' %}
            Manage
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} In this subscription — read-only {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card">
        <div class="spp__card-head">
          <h2 class="spp__h2" style="margin:0;">In this subscription</h2>
          <button type="button" style="border:none;background:transparent;font:600 14px/1 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);padding:8px 0;" data-spp-go="subscription">Details</button>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;" data-spp-list="lines" data-spp-separators>
          <template data-spp-tpl="lines">
            <div class="spp__media">
              <span class="spp__thumb" data-spp-thumb><img data-spp-img alt=""></span>
              <div class="spp__media-body">
                <div class="spp__media-title" data-spp-field="title">FreshWipes jar</div>
                <div class="spp__media-meta">
                  <span data-spp-field="unitPrice">$24.90</span> each ·
                  <span data-spp-field="subtitle">for Bella &amp; Max</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              {%- comment -%} Quantity is displayed, not editable. {%- endcomment -%}
              <span class="spp__media-price" style="font-weight:600;">×<span data-spp-field="quantity">2</span></span>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>

        <p class="spp__note" style="margin-top:16px;">
          To change what&rsquo;s in your routine, message support and we&rsquo;ll sort it for you.
        </p>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Deliveries preview {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card">
        <div class="spp__card-head">
          <h2 class="spp__h2" style="margin:0;">Deliveries</h2>
          <button type="button" style="border:none;background:transparent;font:600 14px/1 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);padding:8px 0;" data-spp-go="deliveries">View all</button>
        </div>
        <div data-spp-list="deliveriesPreview">
          <template data-spp-tpl="deliveriesPreview">
            <div class="spp__delivery">
              <span class="spp__date-tile">
                <span data-spp-field="mon">SEP</span>
                <b data-spp-field="day">8</b>
              </span>
              <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
                <div class="spp__delivery-title" data-spp-field="title">Next delivery</div>
                <div class="spp__delivery-meta" data-spp-field="meta">FreshWipes ×2, EyeWipes ×1</div>
              </div>
              <span class="spp__delivery-status" data-spp-field="status">Scheduled</span>
            </div>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ===== Side column ===== {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="spp__split-side">

      {%- comment -%} VetPoints — solid blue, white text/icons {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__points">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span class="spp__badge">VetPoints</span>
          <span style="opacity:.9;">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'sparkle', size: 22, stroke: '#FFFFFF' %}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spp__points-value">
          <b data-spp-field="loyalty.points">640</b>
          <span>points</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spp__progress spp__progress--on-blue">
          <span data-spp-style-width="loyalty.progressPercent"></span>
        </div>
        <p>
          <span data-spp-field="loyalty.toNextReward">160</span> more points unlock
          <span data-spp-field="loyalty.nextRewardName">a free plush toy</span>.
          Each renewal adds <span data-spp-field="loyalty.perRenewal">100</span> points.
        </p>
        <p class="spp__points-fine" data-spp-field="loyalty.disclosure">Placeholder points logic &mdash; thresholds and rewards are configurable.</p>
        <button type="button" class="spp__btn" data-spp-go="loyalty">View rewards</button>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Account summary. Address and payment are read-only: Phoenix documents
        no address or payment-method mutation for the portal, so these are
        presented as information with support as the route to change them.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card spp__card--rows">
        <div class="spp__row" style="cursor:default;">
          <span class="spp__row-label">Delivery address</span>
          <span class="spp__row-value" data-spp-field="subscription.addressShort">Portland, OR</span>
        </div>
        <div class="spp__row" style="cursor:default;">
          <span class="spp__row-label">Payment method</span>
          <span class="spp__row-value" data-spp-field="subscription.paymentShort">Visa ···· 4242</span>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="spp__row" data-spp-go="account">
          <span class="spp__row-label">Help &amp; account settings</span>
          {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-right' %}
        </button>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} 100-day money-back guarantee — final approved native card {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__guarantee">
        <span class="spp__guarantee-icon">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'shield-check' %}</span>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
          <h2><b>100-day</b> money-back guarantee</h2>
          <p>Your routine is protected for 100 days. If you&rsquo;re not satisfied, contact us for a full refund.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
